WEBVTT

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:43.200
Take a photo with Auntie.

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:45.520
For the memories.

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:46.680
You finally came back.

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:48.640
Come on.

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:51.720
One, two, three.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:52.520
Good.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:53.440
Okay.

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:54.600
Stay here for a bit.

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:55.680
I'll go cook.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:10.880
Ye is back.

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:13.360
First, you need to

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:14.040
solve the issue here.

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:14.800
Only after that,

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:16.120
you could bring this on.

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:18.040
Pay attention to the ratio

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:19.120
between the front and the rear.

00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:20.520
Go back and compare it

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:21.079
with that plan again.

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:22.600
Okay. Thanks, Engineer Xing.

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:35.600
Booked the earliest flight tomorrow.

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:40.240
Look at these dishes.

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:42.200
See if they're still your favorites.

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:44.000
Now,

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:45.760
I don't cook with lard anymore.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.079
So don't worry. Eat up.

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:49.960
I've missed this taste.

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:51.360
It's just...

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:53.280
Isn't it too much?

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:54.280
The two of us can't finish it.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:56.280
Here in Zhazhating,

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.760
food never goes unfinished.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:02:59.600
Come on.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:00.840
Lanfang.

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:01.840
Fangfang.

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:02.760
Right on time.

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:04.600
Auntie Shanxi. Auntie Yufen.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:05.280
Ye.

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:06.600
It's been so long.

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:07.520
Sit down. Sit down.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:09.920
What a feast you two made.

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:11.360
Great.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:12.600
Food is all ready for us.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.440
Eat, eat. I'm starving.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:16.520
Thank you.

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:17.680
The food is good today.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:18.280
Not bad.

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:19.560
Here.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:20.240
Ye.

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:22.600
At Big G's wedding, it was packed.

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:23.760
We didn't get to talk to you.

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:25.560
Today, let's have a proper chat.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:26.800
Yes. Today,

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.840
let's drink and catch up properly.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:31.400
I was just talking with Lanfang

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:32.400
about a project.

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:33.680
This time,

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:34.520
I came with

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:36.160
a rural-support project for Chang Island.

00:03:37.079 --> 00:03:37.800
My company

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:39.440
wants to expand

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:40.680
Chang Island's industrial chain.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:46.280
This is the planning report.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.000
This is wonderful, Ye.

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:50.880
We're thinking the same thing.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:51.600
Really.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:52.880
I've noticed lately

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.120
Livestreams for local farmers are a hit.

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:56.280
I was thinking

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:57.440
whether I could

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:58.720
try livestreaming too.

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:01.280
We have so much seafood here.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:03.120
I could show everyone

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.400
how to cook seafood

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:05.160
and how to eat it.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:07.720
My seafood noodles...

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:09.800
Can I turn them into a brand?

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.240
Of course you can.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.360
Livestream e-commerce is huge now.

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:14.720
You can livestream and sell products.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:15.680
It could even make

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:16.640
Zhazhating popular.

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:17.320
Exactly.

00:04:17.399 --> 00:04:19.120
If you really start livestreaming,

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.399
I'll send viewers to your stream.

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:22.680
Although

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:24.280
I don't have that many followers,

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:25.680
I'll still send viewers your way.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:28.440
Lanfang, you're a big influencer.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:30.600
50,000 followers, a real influencer!

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:33.840
If you really go live,

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:35.320
I'll be there to click likes

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:36.560
and gifts.

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:37.520
I'll send you sports cars.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:38.280
Yufen.

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:38.880
Oh my.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:39.720
So generous.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:40.600
Absolutely.

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:41.520
Auntie Shanxi,

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:42.400
are you starting

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:43.440
a second act in your career?

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:44.880
I support you.

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:46.640
No second act.

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:49.120
Mainly, Ye, you inspired me.

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:50.600
And isn't the country

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:51.200
strongly developing

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:52.520
the marine economy now?

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:54.120
We should do our part.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:54.800
Absolutely.

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:57.200
The three beauties of Zhazhating,

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:59.240
if you want to do something,

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:00.960
there's nothing you can't do.

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:01.920
Yes, yes.

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:02.440
Right.

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:02.920
Come on.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:03.880
To the three beauties.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:04.680
Good.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:06.440
Cheers.

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:02.720
Of course you do.

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:04.840
When you fix phones,

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:05.760
you're always looking down.

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.240
That's bad for your neck.

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:13.440
Fine.

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:15.520
Then I'll wear it.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:28.520
Auntie.

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:32.159
Auntie.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:43.080
[Ye, I've got errands in town.]

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:45.120
[Sandwiches and coffee are in the fridge.]

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:46.680
[I left the key on the table.]

00:06:47.159 --> 00:06:48.400
[I may stay at the shop tonight.]

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:49.840
[Remember to lock the door if you go out.]

00:06:56.159 --> 00:06:56.840
Fix your hair.

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:00.400
Okay.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:04.080
Three, two, one.

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:05.880
Cheese.

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:08.240
Good. Very good. One more.

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:09.600
You, come this way a little.

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:11.840
Okay, everyone look at the camera.

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:19.040
Three, two, one.

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:20.720
Cheese.

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:37.760
Go! Go! Go!

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:38.320
Qing Ye.

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:42.000
Go!

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.000
Run forward.

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:46.159
Catch up.

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:54.080
Go!

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:51.800
I'll see you off here.

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:53.040
Good luck.

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:53.680
Thanks.

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:54.400
Good luck.

00:08:56.960 --> 00:08:57.640
Qing Ye.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:08:59.200
Qing Ye.

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:16.160
In this love story

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.800
of reunions and near misses,

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:20.000
instead of missing each other once more,

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:21.840
why not stop

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:23.360
and return to the lighthouse

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:24.840
where we first met?

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.760
She'll follow the tide of memory

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:28.880
back to you.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:30.720
Sometimes,

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:31.880
only when you slow down

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:34.320
can the right person find you.

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:48.920
When I first met Xing Wu,

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:50.800
I thought he was just

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:52.320
with a wild, spiky haircut,

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:54.560
a prickly rebel.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:57.200
After he became my cousin,

00:11:58.360 --> 00:11:59.840
he installed a door lock for me

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:01.320
and put in an air conditioner, without asking.

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:03.520
If we had

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:04.720
half a chilled watermelon,

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:05.640
it would be perfect.

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:08.960
Eat up.

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:16.160
He stepped forward when I was in danger.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:17.920
Qing Ye, it's me.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:19.800
He became the family I could rely on most.

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:21.960
If you're willing,

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:23.960
you can come back to Zhazhating with me.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:25.920
My home is your home.

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:28.720
When I was at my most helpless,

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:31.720
he gave me the warmest support.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.120
I hope the next time

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:36.000
we meet,

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:39.080
we'll both be our best selves.

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:41.240
Only when reality separated us

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:42.720
did I understand

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:45.560
that my feelings for him

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.000
had long gone beyond family.

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:50.240
They had turned into love.

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:53.680
Fate brought us together again.

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:56.040
In that moment, I finally knew

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:58.640
he was the most dazzling light

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.440
in my life.

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:32.520
Actually, I've always wanted to ask you.

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:34.120
Back then,

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:35.520
why didn't you apply directly

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:36.440
to a school in Beijing?

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:37.880
In my repeat year,

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.960
a professor from a top aerospace school
contacted me.

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:41.360
He said he admired the

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:42.160
aircraft model I made.

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:43.640
The one you made back then...

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:44.680
for Ye Yingjian?

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:45.120
Yes.

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:46.880
That model later won an award.

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:48.560
Ye Yingjian gave the award back to me.

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:51.120
The professor from that school

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:52.720
strongly recommended it.

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:54.880
That way, you could study

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:56.200
the major you really liked.

00:13:57.840 --> 00:13:58.800
If my grades stood out,

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:00.000
you could enter an integrated program

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:02.320
and work on top projects

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.160
in aerospace.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:04.840
Yes.

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:06.240
The prospects were better too.

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:09.280
I gave myself four years

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:10.280
to dig deep into my field,

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:12.640
to earn the chance

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:13.800
to work on projects in Beijing,

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:16.000
and be able to stand beside you.

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:17.640
Only then would I feel

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:18.680
I could truly stand beside you.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:24.560
Back then,

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:26.720
I heard from Shi Min

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:28.880
you applied to that aerospace school.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:31.320
But I really didn't know

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:33.720
there was so much behind it.

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:37.800
Actually, that year,

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:40.240
I went to Beijing to find you.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:42.840
You looked for me?

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:46.160
But your school was strict.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:47.760
I couldn't get in.

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:49.520
But I still waited until I saw you.

00:14:50.520 --> 00:14:51.680
I heard your roommates say

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:53.800
you won first place

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:54.520
in the English debate

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:56.640
and got a national scholarship.

00:14:58.520 --> 00:14:59.880
You could have contacted me.

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:03.240
I still had a long way

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:04.440
to go.

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:06.360
You said

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:08.680
you wouldn't stop for anyone.

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:11.080
I didn't want you

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:12.600
to slow down for me either.

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:21.280
Then from now on,

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:24.040
we'll walk the road together.

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:46.000
Why did you keep this?

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:47.320
To buy you a house.

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:50.360
You said that. Did you forget?

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:52.560
When did I say that?

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:54.200
You said it right there.

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:56.560
Come on.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:58.160
Imperial green, right?

00:15:58.360 --> 00:15:59.160
Sell it.

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:00.800
Once we sell it,

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:03.520
we can live in a big villa.

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:06.520
I was drunk.

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:07.400
I was talking nonsense.

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:08.320
I don't care.

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:09.840
I took it seriously anyway.

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:21.200
Cao Ping.

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:24.160
Xing Wu.

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:25.200
Why are you back?

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:27.560
I was delivering goods nearby,

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:28.760
so I brought you two boxes of seafood.

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:29.800
Thank you.

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:30.240
Thanks.

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:30.680
No problem.

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:33.800
It really has been years.

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:35.000
Compared with before,

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:35.840
you're completely different.

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:36.960
Of course.

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:38.280
He's now

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:39.960
Manager Cao of Shi Family Seafood.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:40.880
Everything on Chang Island

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:41.720
is handled by him.

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:42.800
That impressive?

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:44.800
I knew you can do great things.

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:45.520
Cao Ping,

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.600
come look at my TV.

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:48.440
The screen keeps glitching.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:49.440
Cao Ping,

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:50.680
my air conditioner isn't cooling.

00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:51.920
Can you check it when you have time?

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:53.320
Sure. I'll come by later.

00:16:53.520 --> 00:16:54.120
Hurry, okay?

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:54.920
Thanks.

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:56.120
Ever since you left,

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:57.400
I've taken over all this work.

00:16:57.920 --> 00:16:59.120
Actually, I used to envy you.

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:00.080
You knew a bit of everything.

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:02.040
So I studied some things myself

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:02.600
and helped everyone out.

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:04.240
I worried that after I left,

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:05.319
there'd be no one left

00:17:05.319 --> 00:17:06.040
to handle repairs in Zhazhating.

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:07.560
I didn't expect you to take over.

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:09.040
Now that you're back,

00:17:09.079 --> 00:17:09.839
I'll give the work back to you.

00:17:09.839 --> 00:17:10.480
I won't fight you for it.

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:11.160
Okay?

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:12.599
By the way,

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:13.920
are you free later?

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:15.599
Let's have a little match.

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:17.520
What are you two doing?

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:18.240
Match in what?

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:20.079
Relax.

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:21.760
Purely a technical contest.

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:49.760
Here we go.

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:52.160
Tell me.

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:54.000
What are we competing in?

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:55.880
How about push-ups?

00:17:58.040 --> 00:17:59.160
Ready, start.

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:04.400
Four, five, six, seven.

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:09.800
Twenty, twenty-one, twenty-two.

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:12.920
Twenty-three, twenty-four,
twenty-five, twenty-six.

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:37.000
Fifty-eight, fifty-nine.

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:38.920
Sixty.

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:42.320
Congratulations.

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:44.000
You won.

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:46.520
You let me win, didn't you?

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:49.640
A loss is a loss.

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:50.960
A win is a win.

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:57.600
Next time, let's try something else.

00:18:58.280 --> 00:18:59.040
Then next time,

00:18:59.320 --> 00:18:59.960
I'll still win.

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:06.280
But

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:09.040
in life,

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:09.840
is anything ever absolute?

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:10.520
Right, Xing Wu?

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:19.360
Xing Wu.

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:25.120
I'm sorry.

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:39.200
Some people are like

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:41.320
another version of ourselves.

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:42.600
The clashes

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:44.440
that once kept me up at night

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:46.560
had softened with time

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:47.880
and become the strength

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:50.040
that carried me forward.

00:19:58.360 --> 00:19:59.000
I'm back.

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:02.840
Where's Cao Ping?

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:05.240
He said he'd go back to Chang Island

00:20:05.240 --> 00:20:06.120
after fixing the appliances.

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:08.120
How was it?

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:09.160
Who won?

00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:10.600
Of course, me.

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:12.520
Nothing happened between you two, right?

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:13.960
No.

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:16.000
He just said he owed me an apology.

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:17.320
It's been five years.

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:18.640
Seeing everyone

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:19.960
moving in a better direction,

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:20.960
I'm happy for him.

00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:23.920
I'm happy for you too.

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:26.400
Hungry?

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:28.560
I'll cook.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:31.080
My boyfriend is going

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:31.960
to cook for me himself?

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:32.600
Absolutely.

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:33.680
You haven't been

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:34.440
eating properly in Beijing, have you?

00:20:34.720 --> 00:20:36.080
I have, sort of.

00:20:37.640 --> 00:20:39.040
Small restaurants downstairs,

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:40.600
the company cafeteria,

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:42.200
mall restaurants,

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:43.880
and takeout sometimes.

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:45.240
Don't always eat takeout.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:46.600
You need to eat properly.

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:47.280
Got it?

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:48.720
Got it.

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:50.800
Then shouldn't you make it

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:52.360
Michelin-chef level?

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:54.760
Okay.

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:56.720
For you, I'll learn to cook.

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:58.440
Chinese and Western, alternating.

00:20:59.560 --> 00:21:00.360
That's more like it.

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:01.680
Then I'll wait to eat.

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:02.600
Okay. Wait for it.

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:11.160
Help me tie my apron.

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:20.360
Don't tie it too tight.

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:23.280
Don't worry.

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:24.760
So I won't delay

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:25.760
my chance to eat good food,

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:27.280
I tied you

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:28.680
a nice loose bow.

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:39.360
Hello?

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:40.840
I knew long ago

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:41.920
something was up with you and Xing Wu.

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:42.880
There must be a story.

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:43.800
Tell me.

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:45.280
How far have you two gone?

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:48.840
Just holding hands and hugging.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:50.000
Have you kissed?

00:21:53.840 --> 00:21:54.880
Not bad.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:55.640
How many times?

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:56.920
Once.

00:21:57.360 --> 00:21:58.160
Only once?

00:21:59.240 --> 00:22:00.960
Don't underestimate that once.

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:02.640
It may have been just once,

00:22:03.160 --> 00:22:05.520
but it lasted from sunset till dark.

00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:06.680
A whole hour.

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:09.640
Qing Ye, you two are amazing.

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:10.960
Get out of here.

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:23.360
Hello?

00:22:23.560 --> 00:22:24.080
Xing Wu.

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:24.960
Congratulations.

00:22:25.080 --> 00:22:25.960
Official congrats

00:22:25.960 --> 00:22:27.120
from the whole team

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:29.080
and our best wishes.

00:22:29.560 --> 00:22:30.640
You found out so fast?

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:32.200
My sister told me.

00:22:32.600 --> 00:22:33.160
She almost shattered

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:34.200
my eardrums.

00:22:34.880 --> 00:22:35.600
You're about to shatter

00:22:35.600 --> 00:22:36.680
mine too.

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:38.080
All right. I won't talk now.

00:22:38.080 --> 00:22:38.680
I'm busy.

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:40.000
Don't brush me off.

00:22:40.280 --> 00:22:41.400
If you two get married,

00:22:41.560 --> 00:22:43.280
my sister and I get head-table seats.

00:22:43.600 --> 00:22:44.360
Sure, sure.

00:22:44.360 --> 00:22:45.440
Sit wherever you want.

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:46.520
Hanging up.

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:08.120
Take a break.

00:23:08.440 --> 00:23:09.040
Eat first.

00:23:09.760 --> 00:23:10.240
Soon.

00:24:17.760 --> 00:24:19.040
Where did you get that hair tie?

00:24:22.520 --> 00:24:23.720
A girl left it here.

00:24:24.680 --> 00:24:25.600
A girl?

00:24:28.960 --> 00:24:29.560
Are you mad?

00:24:31.440 --> 00:24:32.360
When was this?

00:24:33.280 --> 00:24:33.680
Who?

00:24:34.280 --> 00:24:34.960
Come clean.

00:24:37.520 --> 00:24:38.600
This girl is called

00:24:39.360 --> 00:24:39.920
Qing Ye.

00:24:41.280 --> 00:24:42.920
Five years ago, she left this hair tie

00:24:43.160 --> 00:24:44.200
in Zhazhating.

00:25:56.680 --> 00:25:57.800
It's been so long,

00:25:59.240 --> 00:26:00.120
and you still kept it.

00:26:01.800 --> 00:26:02.760
Because anything of yours

00:26:03.760 --> 00:26:04.560
is precious

00:26:05.280 --> 00:26:06.080
to me.

00:26:09.240 --> 00:26:10.160
I want a reward.

00:26:22.840 --> 00:26:23.600
Bro Wu.

00:26:27.640 --> 00:26:28.160
Bro Wu.

00:26:30.200 --> 00:26:31.200
Why are you here?

00:26:31.760 --> 00:26:33.600
We came to congratulate you.

00:26:33.640 --> 00:26:34.960
What perfect timing.

00:26:38.720 --> 00:26:40.040
You... you guys...

00:26:40.360 --> 00:26:41.040
You told them?

00:26:41.400 --> 00:26:42.200
I didn't say anything.

00:26:42.640 --> 00:26:43.080
Then...

00:26:43.560 --> 00:26:45.080
then how did you know?

00:27:14.800 --> 00:27:15.440
Here, here, here.

00:27:17.640 --> 00:27:19.280
So that's how.

00:27:20.520 --> 00:27:21.080
Bro Wu,

00:27:22.040 --> 00:27:23.320
not bad.

00:27:23.560 --> 00:27:24.520
After all these years,

00:27:24.520 --> 00:27:25.360
we finally get couple content.

00:27:28.840 --> 00:27:30.000
You're Boss Hao now,

00:27:30.200 --> 00:27:31.520
and you still remember the wild dog thing?

00:27:32.040 --> 00:27:33.120
I'm just happy.

00:27:33.520 --> 00:27:34.200
I officially announce

00:27:34.520 --> 00:27:35.960
you two are my favorite ship

00:27:35.960 --> 00:27:37.320
this year.

00:27:37.680 --> 00:27:39.240
I'm so happy, Qing Ye.

00:27:39.520 --> 00:27:40.080
See?

00:27:40.280 --> 00:27:41.320
The luck from the bouquet

00:27:41.320 --> 00:27:42.680
did pass on to you.

00:27:43.040 --> 00:27:44.440
I hope you and Bro Wu

00:27:44.440 --> 00:27:45.720
will end up together.

00:27:45.880 --> 00:27:46.560
Thank you.

00:27:46.560 --> 00:27:47.840
You even came all this way.

00:27:48.160 --> 00:27:48.760
Let's toast.

00:27:48.960 --> 00:27:50.400
Here's to happiness, love,

00:27:50.840 --> 00:27:52.800
and better days ahead.

00:27:53.080 --> 00:27:54.520
And, uh, may your career thrive.

00:27:56.560 --> 00:27:57.720
Come on, cheers, cheers.

00:27:57.840 --> 00:27:59.160
Cheers.

00:28:05.680 --> 00:28:06.520
Manager Qing,

00:28:07.360 --> 00:28:08.240
you're really busy.

00:28:09.880 --> 00:28:11.520
Mine are small matters.

00:28:11.520 --> 00:28:12.600
How can I compare with you?

00:28:13.200 --> 00:28:14.280
Your work

00:28:14.280 --> 00:28:15.280
literally goes up into the sky.

00:28:16.520 --> 00:28:17.600
Go ahead and tease me.

00:28:19.120 --> 00:28:20.560
I'm telling the truth.

00:28:23.680 --> 00:28:24.800
I guess you're not wrong.

00:28:32.360 --> 00:28:33.240
I'll pick you up tonight.

00:28:34.880 --> 00:28:35.920
You're not working overtime today, right?

00:28:36.120 --> 00:28:36.680
No overtime.

00:28:37.000 --> 00:28:38.440
Okay. I'm going to the company.

00:28:42.520 --> 00:28:42.960
Bye.

00:28:43.280 --> 00:28:43.760
Bye.

00:28:52.120 --> 00:28:53.200
The due diligence on Chang Island

00:28:53.320 --> 00:28:54.240
is going very smoothly.

00:28:54.680 --> 00:28:55.520
The aquaculture farm owners

00:28:55.520 --> 00:28:56.880
are all highly willing to cooperate.

00:28:57.200 --> 00:28:58.160
We've completed the survey.

00:28:58.240 --> 00:28:59.400
It's already in the final stage.

00:29:01.360 --> 00:29:02.160
Qing Ye,

00:29:02.520 --> 00:29:03.680
I truly admire

00:29:03.680 --> 00:29:04.920
your ability to find gold.

00:29:06.440 --> 00:29:07.520
Whether our group can win

00:29:07.520 --> 00:29:08.520
the top prize internally this year

00:29:08.800 --> 00:29:09.880
depends on how wide

00:29:09.960 --> 00:29:10.800
you can cast this net.

00:29:11.360 --> 00:29:12.080
Don't worry, boss.

00:29:12.280 --> 00:29:13.320
I'll do my best.

00:29:13.640 --> 00:29:14.320
That issue from last time

00:29:14.320 --> 00:29:15.000
has been solved, right?

00:29:15.120 --> 00:29:15.880
It's solved.

00:29:16.760 --> 00:29:17.760
Any other problems now?

00:29:21.200 --> 00:29:21.920
The project Professor Lu

00:29:21.920 --> 00:29:22.920
assigned to your side...

00:29:23.360 --> 00:29:24.920
How far along are you now?

00:29:25.000 --> 00:29:25.640
I'm at about

00:29:25.640 --> 00:29:26.360
fifty percent.

00:29:42.800 --> 00:29:44.280
Finally finished.

00:29:45.040 --> 00:29:45.960
We're home too.

00:29:46.760 --> 00:29:47.800
I'm exhausted.

00:29:47.800 --> 00:29:49.280
Battery drained.

00:29:50.320 --> 00:29:50.880
I can't walk anymore.

00:29:53.120 --> 00:29:53.920
You don't have to walk.

00:30:05.560 --> 00:30:06.000
Come here.

00:30:11.720 --> 00:30:12.520
What do you want for dinner?

00:30:13.080 --> 00:30:13.960
Seafood noodles.

00:30:14.480 --> 00:30:14.920
Seafood noodles.

00:30:15.320 --> 00:30:16.000
What else?

00:30:16.640 --> 00:30:17.560
Sea urchin egg custard.

00:30:31.520 --> 00:30:31.960
Dad.

00:30:32.520 --> 00:30:33.160
Hello, Uncle.

00:30:36.200 --> 00:30:37.000
Wait for me a second.

00:30:59.160 --> 00:31:00.440
I really like Xing Wu.

00:31:01.760 --> 00:31:03.360
I'm happy being with him.

00:31:03.960 --> 00:31:04.960
I can tell.

00:31:06.800 --> 00:31:08.280
You insisted on staying in Beijing.

00:31:08.280 --> 00:31:09.120
Was it because of him?

00:31:12.360 --> 00:31:13.280
Not entirely.

00:31:13.880 --> 00:31:15.520
I made that decision

00:31:15.840 --> 00:31:17.120
after thinking carefully

00:31:17.440 --> 00:31:18.520
about my future.

00:31:20.320 --> 00:31:21.000
When I brought you

00:31:21.000 --> 00:31:22.400
back from Zhazhating,

00:31:23.360 --> 00:31:24.640
I lent their family some money.

00:31:24.640 --> 00:31:25.240
Did you know that?

00:31:31.520 --> 00:31:32.400
A few years later,

00:31:32.400 --> 00:31:33.520
he gave me this card.

00:31:33.880 --> 00:31:35.000
There was 150,000 in it.

00:31:35.880 --> 00:31:36.840
He paid back everything

00:31:36.840 --> 00:31:37.920
the money I gave his family

00:31:37.960 --> 00:31:39.560
for taking care of you,

00:31:40.200 --> 00:31:41.040
plus the Xuan Island renovation costs,

00:31:41.840 --> 00:31:42.960
with interest, all in one payment.

00:31:49.240 --> 00:31:49.680
He...

00:31:50.880 --> 00:31:52.400
Where did he get so much money?

00:31:55.200 --> 00:31:56.720
He said it was

00:31:56.720 --> 00:31:57.360
patent royalties from those years.

00:31:58.200 --> 00:31:59.240
But you can imagine

00:32:00.240 --> 00:32:01.080
it must also have been money

00:32:01.640 --> 00:32:03.200
he saved by living frugally.

00:32:05.880 --> 00:32:07.000
After all,

00:32:07.000 --> 00:32:08.040
I failed in my own marriage too.

00:32:09.080 --> 00:32:11.520
Who you date is your decision.

00:32:12.280 --> 00:32:13.440
I won't interfere too much.

00:32:15.040 --> 00:32:16.920
But one fact can't be denied.

00:32:18.440 --> 00:32:20.040
There are real gaps

00:32:20.080 --> 00:32:21.160
between our two families

00:32:21.680 --> 00:32:23.520
in many ways.

00:32:27.400 --> 00:32:28.240
I'm worried

00:32:28.880 --> 00:32:29.880
that as you spend time together,

00:32:29.880 --> 00:32:31.440
you'll face many conflicts.

00:32:44.160 --> 00:32:45.760
To catch up with my pace,

00:32:46.200 --> 00:32:47.120
he was willing to wait five years.

00:32:48.440 --> 00:32:49.440
So I believe,

00:32:50.240 --> 00:32:51.120
no matter what,

00:32:52.400 --> 00:32:53.840
he'll work hard enough

00:32:53.840 --> 00:32:55.000
to bridge every gap.

00:33:13.360 --> 00:33:14.280
What did your dad say?

00:33:14.840 --> 00:33:15.920
He's not angry, is he?

00:33:17.720 --> 00:33:18.320
No.

00:33:19.000 --> 00:33:19.640
Let's talk when we get home.

00:33:20.080 --> 00:33:20.560
Come on.

00:33:37.400 --> 00:33:38.560
What are you making for me?

00:33:39.960 --> 00:33:40.680
Seafood noodles.

00:33:45.520 --> 00:33:47.560
Can you make baked pumpkin custard?

00:33:50.360 --> 00:33:51.000
I'll look it up.

00:33:59.840 --> 00:34:00.840
Do you have lemons at home?

00:34:01.320 --> 00:34:02.040
Maybe in the fridge.

00:34:08.199 --> 00:34:08.719
Are there any?

00:34:10.400 --> 00:34:11.159
I can't find them.

00:34:22.120 --> 00:34:22.719
Found them?

00:34:24.040 --> 00:34:27.360
I found milk and white sugar.

00:34:28.040 --> 00:34:28.679
Will that work?

00:35:03.200 --> 00:35:04.200
It's so good.

00:35:04.680 --> 00:35:05.760
I didn't know Beibei pumpkin

00:35:05.760 --> 00:35:06.640
could be made this way.

00:35:07.440 --> 00:35:08.680
I'll make it for you whenever you want.

00:35:08.720 --> 00:35:09.120
Okay.

00:35:13.480 --> 00:35:14.520
I only found out today

00:35:15.200 --> 00:35:16.840
that you've been repaying money for years.

00:35:18.080 --> 00:35:18.560
If my dad

00:35:18.760 --> 00:35:20.120
hadn't told me today,

00:35:20.520 --> 00:35:21.440
were you

00:35:21.760 --> 00:35:22.800
never going to tell me?

00:35:24.960 --> 00:35:25.880
Your dad told you everything?

00:35:28.760 --> 00:35:30.160
Most of it was

00:35:30.160 --> 00:35:31.920
scholarship money from school,

00:35:32.360 --> 00:35:33.280
patent royalties and things like that.

00:35:33.680 --> 00:35:34.320
It's not worth mentioning.

00:35:37.440 --> 00:35:38.120
Xing Wu.

00:35:39.600 --> 00:35:40.840
You've had a hard time all these years.

00:35:43.400 --> 00:35:44.640
What else did your dad tell you?

00:35:45.280 --> 00:35:47.360
Was he strongly against

00:35:47.360 --> 00:35:48.120
us being together?

00:35:50.640 --> 00:35:53.360
Not against it,

00:35:55.000 --> 00:35:56.160
but not exactly supportive either.

00:35:56.960 --> 00:35:57.600
It's just...

00:35:58.440 --> 00:36:00.320
he's still a little worried.

00:36:23.840 --> 00:36:25.360
To catch up with my pace,

00:36:25.800 --> 00:36:26.760
he was willing to wait five years.

00:36:28.080 --> 00:36:29.120
So I believe,

00:36:30.160 --> 00:36:31.040
no matter what,

00:36:32.320 --> 00:36:33.360
in the future,

00:36:33.360 --> 00:36:34.920
he'll work hard to bridge every gap.

00:36:36.960 --> 00:36:38.520
Are you sure you won't regret it?

00:36:39.800 --> 00:36:40.640
In your words,

00:36:40.640 --> 00:36:42.200
you're dating down.

00:36:44.680 --> 00:36:45.640
For the same question,

00:36:46.800 --> 00:36:48.120
my mom had an answer too.

00:36:50.560 --> 00:36:51.200
She said

00:36:52.240 --> 00:36:53.440
Love is a bet you choose to make,

00:36:53.840 --> 00:36:55.200
and whatever happens, you own it.

00:36:56.120 --> 00:36:58.000
She gave it everything she had

00:36:58.400 --> 00:36:59.840
and stayed true to herself.

00:37:01.000 --> 00:37:02.520
Even if it didn't work out,

00:37:03.680 --> 00:37:05.680
she never regretted having loved him.

00:37:13.240 --> 00:37:13.800
Qing Ye,

00:37:14.520 --> 00:37:15.560
in a few days,

00:37:15.800 --> 00:37:17.080
I plan to visit your dad.

00:37:18.280 --> 00:37:19.200
After all, with some things,

00:37:19.440 --> 00:37:20.520
taking the first step yourself

00:37:20.720 --> 00:37:21.880
is what shows real sincerity.

00:37:26.840 --> 00:37:28.280
Bring him home sometime.

00:37:29.360 --> 00:37:29.840
See?

00:37:31.640 --> 00:37:32.680
What a coincidence.

00:37:34.280 --> 00:37:35.440
He wants to meet you too.

00:37:40.640 --> 00:37:41.880
I've finally waited for this day.

00:37:42.680 --> 00:37:43.280
Don't worry.

00:37:43.760 --> 00:37:44.520
I'm ready.

00:37:47.640 --> 00:37:48.520
I believe in you.

00:37:49.200 --> 00:37:50.000
And I believe in myself.

00:37:51.320 --> 00:37:52.200
Come on. Cheers.

00:37:59.560 --> 00:38:00.520
Easy.

00:38:00.800 --> 00:38:01.760
You can't hold your liquor.

00:38:02.600 --> 00:38:03.680
How can you say I can't?

00:38:03.680 --> 00:38:04.520
That was before.

00:38:04.520 --> 00:38:05.720
Now I can drink really well.

00:38:08.160 --> 00:38:09.000
Do you remember what you're like

00:38:09.000 --> 00:38:09.520
when you're drunk?

00:38:09.880 --> 00:38:10.640
In Zhazhating?

00:38:13.200 --> 00:38:13.800
What did I do?

00:38:13.960 --> 00:38:15.600
There was an abandoned boat by the sea.

00:38:16.400 --> 00:38:17.680
You insisted on dragging me onto it.

00:38:17.720 --> 00:38:19.040
You said, Captain, set sail.

00:38:19.280 --> 00:38:19.880
And called me

00:38:20.280 --> 00:38:20.920
Jack.

00:38:21.640 --> 00:38:22.760
Me, Rose.

00:38:23.040 --> 00:38:24.120
Jack.

00:38:25.240 --> 00:38:25.880
Rose.

00:38:26.240 --> 00:38:26.840
Jack.

00:38:27.160 --> 00:38:27.680
Rose.

00:38:27.720 --> 00:38:28.520
Did I?

00:38:28.520 --> 00:38:29.520
I did not. You did.

00:38:29.520 --> 00:38:30.400
That was still the mild part.

00:38:30.440 --> 00:38:31.560
Then you

00:38:32.120 --> 00:38:33.120
insisted on performing for me.

00:38:33.520 --> 00:38:34.280
What did I perform?

00:38:35.160 --> 00:38:36.040
the Monkey King's birth scene.

00:38:43.320 --> 00:38:44.520
Don't give me a play-by-play.

00:38:44.520 --> 00:38:45.400
I hate when people do

00:38:45.400 --> 00:38:45.920
drunk recaps.

00:38:45.920 --> 00:38:46.840
And the Little Swan dance.

00:38:47.560 --> 00:38:48.520
Good. Today,

00:38:49.520 --> 00:38:50.240
let's settle this.

00:38:50.440 --> 00:38:50.840
Come on.

00:38:51.000 --> 00:38:51.440
Come on.

00:38:51.520 --> 00:38:52.000
Come on.

00:39:12.680 --> 00:39:13.800
I want to build a plane.

00:39:14.160 --> 00:39:16.240
I want to build the biggest,

00:39:17.000 --> 00:39:18.520
tallest plane.

00:39:18.760 --> 00:39:19.960
Do you know? From here,

00:39:20.520 --> 00:39:22.520
I can fly a paper plane to...

00:39:22.640 --> 00:39:23.240
To where?

00:39:23.320 --> 00:39:23.920
Haidian.

00:39:24.080 --> 00:39:24.720
This is Haidian.

00:39:24.720 --> 00:39:26.000
You're flying to Haidian?

00:39:26.400 --> 00:39:27.760
Do you know, before,

00:39:28.920 --> 00:39:29.800
I wanted to fly.

00:39:30.040 --> 00:39:31.120
Now I don't.

00:39:31.360 --> 00:39:32.160
Then where do you want to go?

00:39:32.240 --> 00:39:33.440
Guess what I want to do now.

00:39:33.680 --> 00:39:34.360
I don't know.

00:39:34.360 --> 00:39:35.080
Tell me.

00:39:35.680 --> 00:39:38.440
Now I want to leave Earth,

00:39:39.040 --> 00:39:39.880
fly into the universe,

00:39:40.720 --> 00:39:41.880
fly into outer space.

00:39:42.920 --> 00:39:43.760
Outer space?

00:39:44.240 --> 00:39:44.920
Where are you going?

00:39:45.080 --> 00:39:45.920
Do you want to go?

00:39:46.600 --> 00:39:47.400
Will you take me?

00:39:47.760 --> 00:39:48.480
Of course.

00:39:49.000 --> 00:39:50.200
Of course I'll take you.

00:39:50.920 --> 00:39:51.360
Okay.

00:39:51.560 --> 00:39:52.400
Really?

00:39:52.440 --> 00:39:53.640
Of course it's real.

00:39:53.760 --> 00:39:55.680
I'll build a plane, then a rocket.

00:39:55.840 --> 00:39:56.920
Then we'll go to outer space.

00:39:57.080 --> 00:39:57.760
We'll elope.

00:39:58.680 --> 00:39:59.800
We're done playing on Earth.

00:40:00.240 --> 00:40:00.720
Okay.

00:40:00.880 --> 00:40:01.520
I believe you.

00:40:01.640 --> 00:40:02.600
Can I believe you?

00:40:02.920 --> 00:40:04.400
When Jack says something,

00:40:04.680 --> 00:40:05.840
he means it.

00:40:06.280 --> 00:40:06.800
Good.

00:40:07.400 --> 00:40:08.320
Then from now on,

00:40:08.600 --> 00:40:10.040
Rose won't jump either.

00:40:10.280 --> 00:40:13.000
She'll follow Jack and fly.

00:40:13.720 --> 00:40:14.880
Fly.

00:40:15.120 --> 00:40:16.160
Fly.

00:40:16.520 --> 00:40:17.400
Fly.

00:40:18.760 --> 00:40:19.400
Fly.

00:40:22.000 --> 00:40:22.960
My old dream

00:40:22.960 --> 00:40:24.520
was to soar into the sky.

00:40:26.520 --> 00:40:27.160
Impressive.

00:40:27.560 --> 00:40:28.680
Do you want to soar into the sky?

00:40:29.160 --> 00:40:30.120
How would I soar into the sky?

00:40:30.720 --> 00:40:31.320
Climb up.

00:40:31.880 --> 00:40:32.520
Get down.

00:40:33.040 --> 00:40:33.640
Climb up.

00:40:33.680 --> 00:40:34.680
You'll fall.

00:40:36.240 --> 00:40:37.280
How do I soar into the sky?

00:40:51.840 --> 00:40:52.520
Nervous?

00:40:53.560 --> 00:40:54.160
A little.

00:40:54.840 --> 00:40:55.880
First time meeting the family.

00:40:55.920 --> 00:40:56.680
No experience.

00:40:57.400 --> 00:40:59.080
It's my first time bringing a boyfriend

00:40:59.120 --> 00:40:59.960
home to meet my dad too.

00:41:00.040 --> 00:41:01.120
I don't have much experience either.

00:41:01.960 --> 00:41:03.560
Then two negatives make a positive.

00:41:04.880 --> 00:41:05.600
What if my dad

00:41:06.080 --> 00:41:07.400
sets a trap for me?

00:41:08.600 --> 00:41:09.840
Then I'll elope with you.

00:41:11.400 --> 00:41:11.880
Not bad.

00:41:12.160 --> 00:41:13.080
I knew I chose the right person.

00:41:13.840 --> 00:41:14.280
Let's go.

00:41:20.320 --> 00:41:20.760
Dad.

00:41:21.240 --> 00:41:22.560
Mr. Qing, Ye is back.

00:41:22.840 --> 00:41:23.360
Hello, Mr. Qing.

00:41:29.040 --> 00:41:30.200
Give that to me. I'll carry it.

00:41:30.200 --> 00:41:31.040
Okay. Thank you.

00:41:32.120 --> 00:41:32.600
You're here.

00:41:34.520 --> 00:41:35.000
Do you have time?

00:41:35.320 --> 00:41:35.720
Yes.

00:41:36.880 --> 00:41:37.560
Do me a favor.

00:41:41.240 --> 00:41:42.160
I'll go over first.

00:41:49.120 --> 00:41:49.600
Auntie,

00:41:49.760 --> 00:41:51.160
what has my dad been busy with lately?

00:41:51.560 --> 00:41:53.120
Lately,

00:41:53.120 --> 00:41:53.640
he's always in the garden.

00:41:55.040 --> 00:41:56.160
He started planting flowers.

00:42:02.520 --> 00:42:03.440
Do you know how to grow flowers?

00:42:04.560 --> 00:42:05.080
Uncle,

00:42:05.520 --> 00:42:06.880
I grew up in the countryside.

00:42:07.000 --> 00:42:08.520
I've grown wheat and corn.

00:42:08.840 --> 00:42:10.120
I learned some basic gardening too.

00:42:10.360 --> 00:42:11.040
I can grow flowers.

00:42:11.920 --> 00:42:12.280
Right.

00:42:12.800 --> 00:42:14.280
The Welwitschia Qing Ye

00:42:14.280 --> 00:42:15.120
brought back to Zhazhating...

00:42:15.120 --> 00:42:15.840
After the fire,

00:42:16.400 --> 00:42:17.320
I saved it.

00:42:21.040 --> 00:42:22.400
That Welwitschia is still alive?

00:42:22.920 --> 00:42:23.360
Yes.

00:42:29.320 --> 00:42:30.320
This garden

00:42:31.320 --> 00:42:32.120
used to be taken care of

00:42:32.120 --> 00:42:33.160
by Ye's mother.

00:42:33.840 --> 00:42:35.280
As for these flowers and plants,

00:42:35.520 --> 00:42:37.720
how much water, how deep to plant them,

00:42:37.720 --> 00:42:38.520
I can't figure it out.

00:42:39.120 --> 00:42:40.360
So I bought some seeds.

00:42:41.960 --> 00:42:42.840
I planted them four or five days ago,

00:42:42.840 --> 00:42:43.640
but they still haven't sprouted.

00:42:43.640 --> 00:42:44.240
Take a look for me.

00:42:44.600 --> 00:42:45.720
What you planted is...

00:42:46.840 --> 00:42:47.360
Just these.

00:42:53.240 --> 00:42:54.520
Tulips aren't really suitable

00:42:54.520 --> 00:42:55.520
for summer planting.

00:42:55.880 --> 00:42:56.680
High temperatures

00:42:56.800 --> 00:42:58.160
affect their dormancy

00:42:58.160 --> 00:42:59.000
and flower-bud development.

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:01.400
This plumbago is more suitable.

00:43:01.880 --> 00:43:02.520
It likes to grow

00:43:02.520 --> 00:43:03.680
in places with plenty of sunlight.

00:43:04.520 --> 00:43:06.000
But when it gets too hot in summer,

00:43:06.280 --> 00:43:07.240
it also needs proper shade.

00:43:08.080 --> 00:43:08.760
Put it here.

00:43:11.680 --> 00:43:12.200
Looks like

00:43:12.880 --> 00:43:14.320
things with different natures

00:43:15.280 --> 00:43:16.400
shouldn't be forced together.

00:43:17.680 --> 00:43:18.760
Then throw it away.

00:43:20.120 --> 00:43:20.760
No need for that.

00:43:22.800 --> 00:43:23.600
Uncle, how about this?

00:43:25.160 --> 00:43:26.200
We'll need some clay pebbles.